    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But it's not just a slip up, it's the same pattern every single time. i act like i'm making progress and then i just collapse back into the same hole. it feels like i'm just lying to myself and everyone else. what's even the point of trying to get better if i'm just destined to fail? it feels like a waste of time to keep struggling just to end up exactly where i started.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
